feat(share): Implement SSE detection and auto-switch backend
scale: ~228 lines across 7 files [M]

- `crates/vox-share/src/sse_detect.rs`: New module to detect Server-Sent Events (SSE) routes by probing `openapi.json` for `text/event-stream` content types.
