- `crates/vox-share/src/coordinator.rs`: Modified `ShareSession::start` to perform SSE detection. If SSE routes are found and the backend is Cloudflare (which buffers responses), it automatically switches to `localhost.run` for compatibility, unless `allow_buffered_streaming` is true.
- `crates/vox-cli/src/commands/share.rs`: Added `--allow-buffered-streaming` CLI argument to prevent the automatic backend switch for SSE routes.
- `crates/vox-share/tests/fallback_test.rs`: Updated test configurations to include the new `allow_buffered_streaming` field.
- `crates/vox-share/src/lib.rs`: Added `sse_detect` module to `vox-share` crate.
- `crates/vox-share/tests/coordinator_test.rs`: Updated test configurations to include the new `allow_buffered_streaming` field.

